      "what": "the emitted configuration is now handed to the ACCEPTED validator, stage_execution.held_configuration, before anything durable. The 22 missing worker members the reviewer reproduced are named in an operator-facing refusal and no Authority, directory or document is made. Principals are derived WITHOUT building anything -- principal_of is a read, and an Authority that does not exist has no bindings, so the package's own principal_for_endpoint is the answer -- which is what lets the whole document be proved first. The derived identities and paths now go INTO what is validated rather than being grafted on afterwards. The schema is chosen from POOL SHAPE as well as Job count, because /1 permits exactly one worker per role."
